2|0@IWantOut^1440106749#cu9ys8a:anarkingx$:I went through the proper immigration channel. Not just show up and ask for asylum and free support. Those who need actual asylum and refugee status, from places where their lives are in imminent danger (this is the requirement), are absolutely welcome. That is saving people. Accepting another 300-400,000 per year that want to come like many others because it is better than their home, but either can't or don't want to meet the requirements that Germany has set for immigration, so choose to lie for asylum, are not welcome in that deceitful manner. Making it harder for Germany to go through the paperwork and give those spots to people really in dire lifesaving need. Working with countries from where tmany fake asylum seekers are originating, to help give opportunity and improve conditions there, is a better use of the money, for both Germany and the originating countries. Selling fewer weapons out into the world would also help a little. side note: Germany has sold 20% less weapons (by money's count) in 2014 than in 2013 due to more oversight in granting. Still €4.8 Billion though. Number of other thongs to help. Not my job. I paid to and jumped through hoops to immigrate. And Germany probably has one of the fastest easiest normal immigration process and acceptance in all of Europe! And now I gladly pay lots of taxes.
